# Agentic Context Workflow (Agent Requested)

## Default loop

Research → Plan → Execute → Review → Ship. Do not jump to code for ambiguous multi-file work.

## Context assets

| Asset | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Always rules | `core/00`, `project-context` |
| Glob / agent rules | `.cursor/rules/**` |
| Skills | `.cursor/skills/**` |
| Feature brief | `docs/templates/FEATURE_BRIEF.md` |
| Blueprint | `docs/templates/IMPLEMENTATION_BLUEPRINT.md` |
| Korean guide | `docs/pvc-guide/ko/` |

## Skills

- Skills are versioned capabilities with triggers, guardrails, acceptance.
- Progressive disclosure: do not dump skill bodies into always-on rules.
- Use `skill-router` to pick situational skills; never bulk-install marketplaces.

## Session hygiene

New major task → prefer new session; rewind/restate beats stacked corrections; subagents return conclusions only.

